---
import Layout from '@/layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="页面未找到 (404) - 飞渡机场"
  description="抱歉，您访问的页面不存在或已被移除。"
>
  <div class="min-h-[60vh] flex flex-col items-center justify-center text-center px-4 py-16">
    <div class="w-16 h-16 rounded-2xl bg-blue-50 text-blue-600 flex items-center justify-center font-extrabold text-2xl mb-4 border border-blue-100">
      404
    </div>
    <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-extrabold text-slate-900 tracking-tight mb-2">
      抱歉，页面未找到
    </h1>
    <p class="text-sm sm:text-base text-slate-600 max-w-md mb-8">
      你所寻找的页面可能已经被移动、重命名，或者暂时无法访问。
    </p>
    <a
      href="/"
      class="inline-flex items-center justify-center px-6 py-3 rounded-xl bg-blue-600 text-white font-semibold text-sm hover:bg-blue-700 transition-colors shadow-sm"
    >
      返回首页
    </a>
  </div>
</Layout>
